Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 扮演路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam starring as lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.57,0:00:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 扮演米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean starring as michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.19,0:00:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要适应 承担你们的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna suck it up, accept your responsibilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.72,0:00:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,扮演好命运所选的角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}And play the roles that destiny has chosen for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.17,0:00:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么木桩没杀死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't the stake kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是恶作剧精灵啊 或许你根本不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the trickster. But maybe you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.82,0:00:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好啊 加百列 - 大天使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, gabriel. - The archangel?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.65,0:00:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这绝不是你们弟兄间的拳击赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't about some prizefight between your brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.93,0:00:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.89,0:00:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不敢抵抗你的家族而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being too afraid to stand up to your family!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.47,0:00:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是要去做一些蠢事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna do something stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.37,0:00:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比方说 - 去找米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like what? - Michael stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.07,0:00:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.07,0:00:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情会变得非常糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things are about to get really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.43,0:00:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接下来要见的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people that I'm gonna see next,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.61,0:00:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要是想从我身上拿走一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not gonna get anything from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.80,0:00:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就必须先答应我的条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without agreeing to a few conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.28,0:00:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你打算干什么 别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you're thinking of doing, don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.08,0:00:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.36,0:00:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你终于准备好了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're finally ready, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.58,0:00:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有其他选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know there's no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来就没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's never been a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.07,0:00:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer is yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.53,0:00:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.55,0:00:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.75,0:00:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我还有些条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, I have a few conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.36,0:00:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为什么改变主意 - 还不是这一堆破事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What changed your mind? - The damnedest thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.23,0:00:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界末日来临\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the world's ending,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.45,0:00:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被压得不堪重负\N{\fnArial\fs30}The walls are coming down on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:00:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我不想让你失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just didn't want to let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.43,0:01:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 去他妈的命运使然\N{\fnArial\fs30}So screw destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.69,0:01:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用我们的方式 和他们斗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we take the fight to them, do it our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.10,0:01:04.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.60,0:01:17.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（孟西镇 印地安那州）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.70,0:01:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.21,0:02:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.80,0:02:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.86,0:02:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你不能来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy, you can't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.01,0:02:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}'course I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.31,0:02:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得有人来做准备工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's got to get everything ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.56,0:02:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们马上就到了 所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming … all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.52,0:02:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会各司其职\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we've each got our part to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.12,0:02:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.43,0:02:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.54,0:02:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是正餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.49,0:03:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方新开的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice digs, for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.63,0:03:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,真忙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Busy night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.91,0:03:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像暴雨中的港口一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any port in a storm, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.33,0:03:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,您先填下表\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you could just fill this out, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.86,0:03:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.70,0:03:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 您这里有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I think you got a little…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,刮胡子留下的划痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shaving nick there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.76,0:03:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your key.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.91,0:03:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.49,0:04:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这里不会连咖啡店都有吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you wouldn't happen to have a coffee shop, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.24,0:04:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,有自助餐 请随便享用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buffet. All you can eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.79,0:04:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有世上最好吃的派\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best pie in the tri-state area.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.19,0:04:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.93,0:04:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.87,0:04:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 伙计 天堂都没这儿好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, pal … better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.76,0:04:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.29,0:04:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.06,0:04:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But …
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.92,0:04:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.39,0:04:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, lady, I'm just, you know …
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.47,0:04:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.75,0:04:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是不\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.60,0:04:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.56,0:05:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 别皱眉 伙计 吃点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, unpucker, man. Eat something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.55,0:05:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该继续赶路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should hit the road, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,冒这么大雨 真有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this storm? What? I-it's …
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.36,0:05:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,确切地说 是关于圣经中的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's biblical. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.16,0:05:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在本应是生死时速 可我们还在这儿吃派\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-it's friggin' noah's ark out there, and we're eating pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.69,0:05:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这周你才睡了几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many hours of sleep did you get this week?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.11,0:05:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个还是四个\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Three? Four?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.18,0:05:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比已经在查了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby's got his feelers out, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.76,0:05:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也跟十二个州里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have talked with every hoodoo man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.25,0:05:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,受害的男男女女都谈过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And root woman in 12 states.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.76,0:05:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我没有放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I'm not giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.77,0:05:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人说要放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.53,0:05:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.37,0:05:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到战胜路西法的办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna find a way to beat the devil, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.37,0:05:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,用不了多久 我能感觉得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon. I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.82,0:05:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也会找到卡西和亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we will find Cass, we'll find Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.86,0:05:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但身体是革命的本钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are no good to me burnt out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.76,0:05:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.05,0:05:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 让我们过个清闲的晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We've actually got the night off for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.51,0:05:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,享受一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's try to enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.07,0:06:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你多大了 才12吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what are you, 12?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.74,0:06:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一颗年轻的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm young at heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.88,0:06:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.83,0:06:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像洛克菲勒家族一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're like Rockefellers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.19,0:06:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,巧克力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chocolates!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.24,0:06:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要吃你那份吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.22,0:06:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,色情之家13号随时恭候\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Casa erotica 13" On demand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.61,0:06:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.94,0:06:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方好像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't this place kind of…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.85,0:06:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭空出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the middle of nowhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.71,0:06:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,四星级酒店怎么会出现在荒芜的高速路旁\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's four-star hotel doing on a no-star highway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.72,0:07:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.95,0:07:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.77,0:07:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们隔壁房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}The, uh, the room next to ours …
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.18,0:07:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一对男女刚才在亲热\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-the couple that are, uh, joined at the lips …
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.72,0:07:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见他们了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.42,0:07:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛根夫妇是吗 度蜜月的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. And Mrs. Logan … the honeymooners?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.19,0:07:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经结账走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They checked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.11,0:07:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.54,0:07:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们退房了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They checked out?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 就在刚才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm. Mm, just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.35,0:07:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.32,0:07:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看起来似乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sort of seemed like they were, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.63,0:07:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在做那事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in the middle of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.26,0:07:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,很奇怪 度蜜月的人退房时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's kind of weird for honeymooners.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.46,0:07:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟把这个落下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to, uh, check out without this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.33,0:07:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把它放到失物招领处的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just put that right in the lost and found.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.15,0:08:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.67,0:08:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还需要什么帮助吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything else I can help you with?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.18,0:08:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 没问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no, no, we 're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.86,0:08:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Super-fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.29,0:08:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,真诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.67,0:08:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,别听他扯谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Broke the needle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.55,0:08:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧 我对这块地方仔细检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, I'll scope out the joint,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.37,0:08:22.31,Title,0,0,0,0,,你盯着这个诺曼·贝茨（《精神病患者》中的旅馆连环杀手）\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you keep an eye on Norman Bates over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.15,0:08:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 这才一晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, one night off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.19,0:08:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题也太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that too much to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.07,0:09:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没见过人尿尿吗 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no pees how, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.62,0:09:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真美\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.87,0:09:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘴很甜啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌甜蜜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.56,0:09:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 打扰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to interrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.45,0:09:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,客人都到齐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last guest just arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.27,0:09:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切就绪了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So everything's ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.48,0:09:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,向来如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}As it will ever be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.23,0:09:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,食品贮藏室已经满了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pantry's full.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.19,0:09:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,温彻斯特兄弟呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Winchesters?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.22,0:09:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,起了疑心 但在掌控之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suspicious, but under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.11,0:09:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你取到他们的血没\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have their blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.14,0:09:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.79,0:09:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我动作很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.71,0:09:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟俩绝不会知道这伤哪儿来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys never even knew what hit them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.99,0:09:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 墨丘利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mercury.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.93,0:10:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 让我们开始典礼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Let's get this show on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.70,0:10:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一头大象 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- An elephant? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.15,0:10:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一头真的大象吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, an elephant?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.35,0:10:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,像载人巴士那么大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, full-on the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.54,0:10:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这到底\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what the hell…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.76,0:10:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,人都哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.36,0:10:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来猜猜 门锁上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess … it's locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.34,0:10:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 蟑螂们只入住 不会退房吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? The roaches check in, they don't check out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.38,0:10:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想我们是怎么到这儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about how we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.21,0:10:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,90号公路上的临时绕行路\N{\fnArial\fs30}That detour on Line-90?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.42,0:10:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那该死的飓风\N{\fnArial\fs30}The friggin' hurricane?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.48,0:10:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我们是被引导到这的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saying we were led here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.93,0:10:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,像迷宫里的老鼠一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like rats in a maze.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.27,0:11:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 一定要是番茄汤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please be tomato soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.95,0:11:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要是番茄汤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please be tomato soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.97,0:11:12.79,Title,0,0,0,0,,《地狱旅馆》（1980年恐怖电影）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motel hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.35,0:11:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 放我们出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help us! Get us out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.43,0:11:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.00,0:11:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经尽快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going as fast as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.49,0:11:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在我后面 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's somebody behind me, isn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.39,0:12:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不像是个施里纳富人大集会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something tells me this isn't a shriner convention.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.69,0:12:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚餐准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dinner is served.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.62,0:12:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.82,0:12:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们尊贵的客人已经到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our guests of honor have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.42,0:12:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们 谢谢你们大驾光临\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.80,0:12:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我有生之年 从未想过能看到此情此景\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in all my centuries, I never thought I'd see this …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.13,0:12:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多神砥齐聚一堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}This many gods under one roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.44,0:12:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,神灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gods?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.11,0:12:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们正式开始之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, before we get down to brass tacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.35,0:12:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些基本规则需要了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}some ground rules …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.06,0:12:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,严禁互相屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}No slaughtering each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.86,0:12:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抑制你的怒火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curb your wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.07,0:12:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要染指本地的处女们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and, uh, keep your hands off the local virgins.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.91,0:13:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这得低调些\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trying to keep a low profile here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.39,0:13:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we are so, so screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.12,0:13:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道聚集在此的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we all know why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.97,0:13:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,犹太基督教的天启笼罩了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The judeo-christian apocalypse looms over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.55,0:13:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我清楚我们在过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know we've all had our little disagreements.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.15,0:13:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些小争议\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.47,0:13:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在该是不计前嫌\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the time has come to put those aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.40,0:13:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,共创未来的时刻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and look toward the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.94,0:13:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为如果不这样 我们将没有明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause if we don't, we won't have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.93,0:13:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在有了两个极具价值的筹码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we do have two very valuable bargaining chips …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.40,0:13:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,米迦勒和路西法的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael and lucifer's vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.23,0:13:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.71,0:13:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在该做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.52,0:13:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁有好点子 请发言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody have any bright ideas, speak up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.21,0:13:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这间屋子很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a safe room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.37,0:13:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,[汉语] 我们该做的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.62,0:13:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,[汉语] 就是直接杀了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.87,0:13:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不喜欢这口气啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I dot like his tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.00,0:13:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他们 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.56,0:13:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了让天使们再把他俩救活吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the angels here can bring them back again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.37,0:13:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞不懂各位都在激动些啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what everybody's getting so worked up about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.13,0:13:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只不过是两个天使打场架而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just a couple of angels having a slap fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.55,0:13:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是世界末日大决战\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no armageddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.03,0:13:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都知道战斗一结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody knows when the war comes to an end,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.59,0:13:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的巨蟒约尔姆加德就会崛起\N{\fnArial\fs30}the great serpent jormungand rises up,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.28,0:14:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我 就将成为巨狼的食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I, myself, will be eaten by a big wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.47,0:14:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,[汉语] 又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.87,0:14:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 为什么这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, ye? And why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.85,0:14:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你的信仰更现实吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because your beliefs are so much more realistic?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.10,0:14:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个世界不过是在巨龟背上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole world's getting carried around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.35,0:14:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,随身携带的玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the back of a giant turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.39,0:14:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,少废话了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.68,0:14:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,[汉语] 别得罪我们的龟神
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.52,0:14:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能拿我怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.77,0:14:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,[汉语] 让你卷铺盖滚到瓦尔哈拉殿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.68,0:14:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说话时嘴巴放干净点 臭小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You watch your mouth when you talk to me, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.15,0:14:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,[汉语] 臭小子 我比你大
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.11,0:14:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人证明过这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's ever proved that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.74,0:14:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.23,0:14:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.18,0:14:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些大天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}The archangels …
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.15,0:14:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只热衷于暴力\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only thing they understand is violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.53,0:14:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能是生死存亡的结局 没有别的出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ends in blood. There is no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.49,0:14:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他们死 就是我们亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's them…or us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.10,0:15:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言 女神\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all due respect… ma'am…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.83,0:15:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们甚至都没有试着跟他们沟通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}we haven't even tried talking to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.64,0:15:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,迦梨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kali.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.41,0:15:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁征求你的意见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who asked you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.31,0:15:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我们就不能和平相处吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't we all just get along?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.61,0:15:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,加百\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gab…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.35,0:15:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.71,0:15:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这俩笨蛋 总是在错误的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always wrong place, worst time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.60,0:15:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现在不该出现的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}with you muttonheads, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.01,0:15:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.06,0:15:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尔德尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baldur.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.67,0:15:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good seeing you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.41,0:15:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我的请柬是寄丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess my invitation got lost in the mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.31,0:15:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.85,0:15:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你谈谈那房子里的大象\N{\fnArial\fs30}To talk about the elephant in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.75,0:15:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是说你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.63,0:15:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}The apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.90,0:15:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 咱们是没法阻止的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can stop it, gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.19,0:16:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但先说要事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first things first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.49,0:16:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成年人有事要谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}The adults need to have a little conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.86,0:16:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头找你们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.46,0:16:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,镇定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.98,0:16:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did that…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.14,0:16:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,真见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.84,0:16:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 绝对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.34,0:16:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便说下 下次我提议接着赶路\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, next time I say "Let's keep driving, "
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.53,0:16:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们就一直开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, let's keep driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.91,0:16:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 下次一定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, yeah, next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.10,0:16:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 那咱们接下来咋办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, all right, so, what's our next move?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.97,0:16:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I …
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.25,0:16:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.21,0:16:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来咱们得为冰箱里那些可怜人负责了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We grab those poor saps out of the freezer, I guess …
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.34,0:16:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们救出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bust them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.50,0:16:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运的话 还能顺便干掉几个坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gank a few freaks along the way if we're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.32,0:16:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们哪辈子走运过\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when are you ever lucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.04,0:16:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你管呢 咬我啊加百列\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you know what? Bite me, Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.57,0:16:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,等会吧 小年青\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe later, big boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.66,0:16:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.72,0:16:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事一开始就像是你的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this had your stink all over it from the jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.61,0:16:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我是幕后黑手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm behind this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.83,0:16:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.46,0:16:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是你们忠实的帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the costner to your Houston.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.69,0:16:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是来救你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to save your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.21,0:16:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想把我们拉出火坑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to pull us out of the fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.61,0:16:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,答对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.28,0:16:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些神不是想把你们化成灰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those gods are either gonna dust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.66,0:16:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是想用你们做诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}or use you as bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.72,0:17:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管咋样 你们都在劫难逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, you're uber-boned.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.98,0:17:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 可是几个月前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow … 'cause a couple of months ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.21,0:17:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我们得扮演好自己的角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were telling us that we need to play our roles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.06,0:17:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我们往火坑里推呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were uber-boning us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.60,0:17:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 一切还没结束呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohhhhh, the end is still nigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.58,0:17:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,米迦勒和路西法还有戏要演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael and Lucifer are gonna dance the lambada.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.10,0:17:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过不是今夜 不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not tonight. Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.42,0:17:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这关你啥事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.21,0:17:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不在乎呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.12,0:17:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.76,0:17:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,迦梨和我 我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Kali, we, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.16,0:17:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点私情\N{\fnArial\fs30}had a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.51,0:17:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人就是一切啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chick was all hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.20,0:17:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能咋说 我挺多愁善感的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say? I'm sentimental.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.50,0:17:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会赢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they have a chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.62,0:17:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,会战胜撒旦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Against Satan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.60,0:17:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆你真这么想吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.49,0:17:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩你有别的办法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a better idea, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.44,0:17:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是个馊主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.83,0:17:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对路西法来说就是小儿科\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer's gonna turn them into finger paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 趁着能开溜 咱们还是走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's get going while the going's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.87,0:17:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 那你干嘛不把我们传送出去呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, great. Why don't you just zap us out of here, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.73,0:17:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,要能的话 我就这么干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would if I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.78,0:17:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是迦梨有抓住了你们的小辫子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Kali's got you by the short and curlies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.27,0:17:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她用了个血咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a blood spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.79,0:17:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩被捆住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys are on a leash.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:17:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.05,0:18:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是 现在得用点古老的黑魔法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means it's time for a little of the old black magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.63,0:18:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 随便你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Yeah. Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.69,0:18:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要救出冰箱里的废物们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna take the all dirts in the freezer with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.66,0:18:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,想都别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.09,0:18:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你们偷偷弄出去都够难的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be hard enough sneaking you mooks out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.25,0:18:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们叫你洛基 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They called you "Loki, " Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.28,0:18:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说 他们还没弄明白你到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which mean they don't really know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.83,0:18:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉过你 我在证人保护计划里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you … I'm in witness protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.78,0:18:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧 你按我们说的办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, then how about you do what we say,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.78,0:18:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不我们就跟那个异教神之组\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we tell the, uh, legion of doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.32,0:18:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,讲讲你的秘密身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}about your secret identity?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.76,0:18:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看起来可不太像亲善的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't seem like a real pro-angel kind of crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.02,0:18:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你变成哑巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take your voices away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.12,0:18:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我们就写下来 - 我砍掉你的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll write it down. - I'll cut off your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.85,0:18:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人们就会问了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then people are gonna be asking,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.87,0:18:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么到处奔波却没有手\N{\fnArial\fs30}"why are you guys running around with no hands?"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.30,0:18:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.76,0:18:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 我的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bonjour, mon amour.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.38,0:18:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.49,0:18:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总喜欢装作难以获取芳心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always did play hard to get.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.82,0:18:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早都继续我的生活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've moved on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.99,0:19:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.35,0:19:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尔德尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baldur?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.84,0:19:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.84,0:19:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尔德尔很单纯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baldur's uncomplicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.78,0:19:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.90,0:19:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.87,0:19:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 快停手\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.09,0:19:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.40,0:19:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.97,0:19:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想到你会是这种型的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never took you for the type.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.80,0:19:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,浪漫型的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Romantic?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.34,0:19:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜兮兮的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.24,0:19:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你叫我来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who call me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.20,0:19:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为我以为你会认真对待这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I thought you might take this seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.56,0:19:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认真对待了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking this seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.39,0:19:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界末日要来了 大家该找出路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ship's sinking. Time to get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.89,0:19:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 去他的地球 让我们去潘朵拉星球吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, screw this marble. Let's go check out Pandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.24,0:19:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't have to be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.44,0:19:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afraid it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.06,0:19:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我们抵抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we fight…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.08,0:19:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.91,0:20:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么这么肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what makes you such an expert?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.50,0:20:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和那些长着翅膀的红屁股猴子交过一两次手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've tussled with those winged ass-monkeys once or twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.64,0:20:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,伽梨 别再耍小手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kali… no more tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.21,0:20:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我求你了 别这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm begging you … don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.86,0:20:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.03,0:20:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能怪我要劝你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't blame me for trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.08,0:20:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,还爱我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.98,0:20:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.88,0:20:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,加百列死到哪里去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell is Gabriel?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.88,0:20:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定以为我是个傻子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must take me for a fool…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.41,0:21:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,加百列\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.65,0:21:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在属于我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bound to me …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.48,0:21:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}now and forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.01,0:21:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎鬼小分队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghostfacers!Ghostfacers!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎鬼小分队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghostfacers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.08,0:21:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能找到见别人看不见的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}We face the ghosts when the others will not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.14,0:21:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是猎鬼 猎鬼小分队\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the ghost, ghostfacers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.61,0:21:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,一见鬼就退\N{\fnArial\fs30}They leave the kitchen when the kitchen gets hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.74,0:21:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还招实习生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the intern position open?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.44,0:21:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你被雇佣了 - 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're hired! - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.38,0:21:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的脸在那个显示屏吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See my face right in your little box? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.74,0:21:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我的脸要在画面中央\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, my face has got to be right in your box.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.94,0:21:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎鬼小分队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghostfacers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.48,0:21:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们猎鬼 我们猎鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We face the faces, we face the ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.68,0:21:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎鬼小分队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghostfacers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.61,0:21:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你已经死了 好好死着\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're dead, you better stay dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.23,0:21:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.04,0:21:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不然 我们会杀死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause if not, we're gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.90,0:22:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you known?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.46,0:22:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,很早就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.06,0:22:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,营救计划进行的怎样啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the rescue going?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.53,0:22:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好大的惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, surprise, surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.42,0:22:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被恶作剧精灵耍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trickster has tricked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.45,0:22:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,伽梨 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kali…don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.35,0:22:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在是我的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're mine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.01,0:22:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有我想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have something I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.52,0:22:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一把大天使的利刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}An archangel's blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.19,0:22:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,属于大天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the archangel…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.25,0:22:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,加百列的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.71,0:22:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay!Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.19,0:22:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是有翅膀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I got wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.66,0:22:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟护舒宝的护翼似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Kotex.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.16,0:22:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这也丝毫不影响我对路西法的判断\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that doesn't make me any less right about Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.86,0:22:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他骗人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.26,0:22:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.42,0:22:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.72,0:23:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一个逃避者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a runaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.10,0:23:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试着救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.50,0:23:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解自己的哥哥 伽梨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know my brother, Kali.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.29,0:23:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会把你们吓的魂飞魄散\N{\fnArial\fs30}He should scare the living crap out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.32,0:23:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不可能打败他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.46,0:23:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,过程就不说了 我见过这个故事的最后结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've skipped ahead … seen how this story ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.53,0:23:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你们的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your story …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.16,0:23:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}not ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.70,0:23:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,西方人 都傲慢十足\N{\fnArial\fs30}Westerners … I swear, the sheer arrogance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.43,0:23:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为自己是地球上唯一的神族\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're the only ones on earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.69,0:23:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,依仗着上帝的名义烧杀抢掠\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pillage and you butcher in your god's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.22,0:23:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其实你们不是唯一的宗教神话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not the only religion.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.90,0:23:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也不是唯一的神祗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's not the only god.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.75,0:23:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你们可以让地球分崩离析吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you think you can just rip the planet apart?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.46,0:23:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.75,0:23:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上有成千上万的神\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are billions of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.26,0:23:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是最先来这儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we were here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.73,0:23:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是有人活到世界的尽头\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anyone gets to end this world…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.66,0:23:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.76,0:23:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.02,0:24:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.82,0:24:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.86,0:24:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以杀死路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can kill Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.36,0:24:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你们这些原始野蛮的滑头\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you primitive screwheads.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.96,0:24:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.06,0:24:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.56,0:24:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out of options.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.19,0:24:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 等哪一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, on any other given day,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.79,0:24:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会杀了你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be doing my damnedest to, uh, kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.13,0:24:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些肮脏血腥的黑猩猩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You filthy, murdering chimps.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.69,0:24:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, hey…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.45,0:24:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是危急时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Desperate times.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.01,0:24:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以即使我非常地想\N{\fnArial\fs30}So even though I'd love nothing better.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.72,0:25:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,割开你们的喉咙 你们这帮混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Than to slit your throats, you…dicks…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.16,0:25:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还是要帮你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm gonna help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.99,0:25:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你们解决掉路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna help you ice the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.59,0:25:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后照例 我们就可以互杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we can all get back to ganking each other, like normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.46,0:25:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想要路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want Lucifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.93,0:25:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的名字可不在电话薄上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, dude's not in the yellow pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.44,0:25:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我很萨姆 我们可以把他引到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But me and Sam, we can get him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.72,0:25:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.21,0:25:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 你要先把那些主菜端走\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, you let those main courses go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.69,0:25:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.24,0:25:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要么就一起对付路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can either take on the devil together.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.85,0:25:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不你们这些混蛋可以吃掉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you lame-ass bitches can eat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.22,0:25:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有比喻的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.02,0:25:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 大家快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, everybody! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.52,0:25:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Let's go. Let's go. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.62,0:25:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.36,0:25:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 走 离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Go! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.62,0:25:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psst! Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.55,0:25:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别望向我\N{\fnArial\fs30}D… t Don'look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.56,0:25:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,表现自然点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Act natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.20,0:25:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.09,0:26:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 我今天就没碰上自然的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, there is nothing natural about this at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.89,0:26:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.49,0:26:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我会让迦梨拿到我的真刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'd give Kali my real sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.28,0:26:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西可以杀死我呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing can kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.72,0:26:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们拿的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what do they have in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.87,0:26:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.44,0:26:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用一听橙子片变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made it out of a can of diet orange slice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.66,0:26:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.39,0:26:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,去把我们的血偷回来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go snag our blood, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.57,0:26:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.34,0:26:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到你们讲话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.88,0:26:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,迦梨喜欢你 你能混进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kali likes you. You can get close.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.35,0:26:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,血浆一到手 我们就可以溜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lift the plasma, then we vamoose.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.39,0:26:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.19,0:26:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,把真刃交出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand over the real blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.78,0:26:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者干脆硬气点站出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better yet, why don't you sack up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.27,0:26:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我们消灭路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And help us take down Lucifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.14,0:26:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你开玩笑的吧 - 我认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't be serious. - Deadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.73,0:26:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你何时开始跟怪物穿一条腿裤子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when are you butt-buddies with a bunch of monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.64,0:26:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在你眼里就是怪物 我有说错吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all they are to you, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.40,0:26:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 萨姆说得对 我是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you know what? Sam was right. It's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.23,0:26:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是我最好的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's the best idea I've heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.66,0:26:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你还有高招\N{\fnArial\fs30}So unless you have a better one…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.39,0:26:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.11,0:26:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我呢 出去凉快着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, I'm blowing John's town.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.21,0:26:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那群旅鼠要跳崖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those lemmings want to run off a clif.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.75,0:26:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不关我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's their business.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.63,0:26:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看透你了 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see right through you. You know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.13,0:27:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,总说聪明话 一副满不在乎的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}The smart-ass shell, the whole "I could give a crap" thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.76,0:27:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我再清楚不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, it takes one to know one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.76,0:27:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是嘛 - 正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That so? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.01,0:27:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面那些怪物跟你或许不是血亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe those freaks in there aren't your blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.59,0:27:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也算是同族\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they are your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.79,0:27:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们刚刚把我一剑穿心了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just stabbed me in the friggin' heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.56,0:27:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算如此你还是关心他们 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe, but you still give a crap about them, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.97,0:27:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean …
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.72,0:27:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再不出手 他们就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, they're gonna die in there without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.47,0:27:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能杀自己的哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't kill my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.66,0:27:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不能 还是不愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Can't" Or "Won't"?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.82,0:27:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.86,0:27:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,由你来召唤路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're going to summon Lucifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.98,0:27:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.83,0:27:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你们帮我把肋骨上的印记消掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need you to squeegee some stuff from my ribs,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.59,0:27:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他顷刻就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he'll come running.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.50,0:27:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接弄折不是更简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breaking them would be easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.46,0:27:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,演出到此结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.59,0:27:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,刃是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sword's a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.72,0:27:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,加百列依旧活蹦乱跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Gabriel … he's still kicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.72,0:27:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不想告诉你 大姐 你被人耍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to break it to you, sister, but you've been tricked.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.51,0:28:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,入住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Checking in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.50,0:28:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.90,0:28:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢光临\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.47,0:28:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼唤我 算你识相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you did right calling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.85,0:28:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.97,0:28:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面那些家伙的想法 有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way the talk is heading in there, it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.14,0:28:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.61,0:28:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我真不理解你们这些异教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I never understood you pagans.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.27,0:28:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这群 渺小的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're such… petty little things.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.85,0:28:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是杀来杀去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always fighting…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.57,0:28:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,相互出卖 乐此不疲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always happy to sell out your own kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.47,0:28:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪地球最终归了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder you forfeited this planet to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.23,0:28:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们比人类更糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are worse than humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.24,0:28:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至比恶魔更糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're worse than demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.04,0:28:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,却又自称为神\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet you claim to be gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.70,0:29:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还说我傲慢呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they call me prideful.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.57,0:29:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.77,0:29:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.73,0:29:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.13,0:29:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没意义了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.88,0:29:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我们都瞬移出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shazam us out of here, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.17,0:29:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,做不到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.63,0:29:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.70,0:29:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没请示妈咪不能出门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't say "Mother, may I?"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.04,0:30:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 迪恩 很高兴又见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, Dean. Good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.83,0:30:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尔德尔 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baldur…don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.40,0:30:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为这地球是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you own the planet?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.37,0:30:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁给你的权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}What gives you the right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.03,0:30:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,权力不是给的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one gives us the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.57,0:30:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是夺来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.50,0:30:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.37,0:30:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.98,0:30:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟到总比不到强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better late than never, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.63,0:30:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,用生命看好它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guard this with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.90,0:31:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,小路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.90,0:31:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.67,0:31:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.27,0:31:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.06,0:31:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get her out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.47,0:31:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了一个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.36,0:31:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,加百列 你不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.63,0:31:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你一向不大检点 但是这也\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I knew you were slumming, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.43,0:31:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你没传上病\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you didn't catch anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.23,0:31:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.77,0:31:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我兄弟 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my brother, and I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.57,0:31:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你真是个超级大混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are a great big bag of dicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.17,0:31:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚说我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you just say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.17,0:31:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.70,0:31:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶呀呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Boo-hoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.57,0:31:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸凶我了 所以我要把他的玩具都砸烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy was mean to me, so I'm gonna smash up all his toys."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.00,0:31:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,讲话注意点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.23,0:31:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你怎么装受伤者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play the victim all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.77,0:32:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你我之间 大家心里知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you and me … we know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.27,0:32:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸最爱的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad loved you best.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.00,0:32:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,超过米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than Micheal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.37,0:32:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,超过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.40,0:32:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,可自从他带了新宝宝回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he brought the new baby home,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.67,0:32:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就受不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you couldn't handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.53,0:32:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这一切仅仅是你的出气筒\N{\fnArial\fs30}So all this is just a great big temper tantrum.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.80,0:32:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,该成熟点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.63,0:32:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不会坐这个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not getting in that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.03,0:32:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,请上车 公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get in the car, princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.80,0:32:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,加百利 如果你是为米迦勒做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel, if you're doing this for michael …
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.70,0:32:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}screw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.10,0:32:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他站在这里 我一样做了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he were standing here, I'd shiv his ass, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.50,0:32:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背叛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You disloyal …
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.23,0:32:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我对他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm loyal,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.33,0:32:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.77,0:32:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.83,0:32:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些 所谓的天神吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}These…so-called gods?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.97,0:32:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是对人类忠诚 路西法.\N{\fnArial\fs30}To people, Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.73,0:32:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}People.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.17,0:32:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就为了这群蟑螂 心甘情愿去死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're willing to die for a pile of cockroaches?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.27,0:32:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.27,0:33:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为父亲是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because dad was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.43,0:33:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们比我们优秀\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are better than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.70,0:33:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类是残缺不全 缺陷百出的弃物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are broken, flawed abortions.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.53,0:33:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们确实有缺陷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right they're flawed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.80,0:33:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是大多数人都 努力让自己更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a lot of them try… to do better.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.57,0:33:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,学会原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}To forgive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.03,0:33:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你应该去脱衣舞俱乐部逛逛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you should see the Spearmint Rhino.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.08,0:33:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经坐了太久的冷板凳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been riding the pine a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.10,0:33:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我要重回战斗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm in the game now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.59,0:33:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和米迦勒 我谁都不帮\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not on your side or Michael's.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.03,0:33:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为人类而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.77,0:33:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 不要逼我这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother, don't make me do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.43,0:33:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人逼我们做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one makes us do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.97,0:33:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,加百利 你认为自己的奸计得逞了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you think you're doing the right thing, Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.77,0:33:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你的真身在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know where your heart truly lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.37,0:33:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.44,0:34:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的戏法太业余了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amateur hocus-pocus.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.17,0:34:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.00,0:34:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的戏法都是我传授的 弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}you learned all your tricks from me, little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.40,0:34:45.18,Note,0,0,0,0,,（该影片中的所有内容）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.19,0:34:46.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（十八岁以下不得观看）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.68,0:34:54.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（卡萨色情 第十三号）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.16,0:34:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的日记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear diary…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.60,0:34:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,做一个拥有无上权力的集团总裁太有趣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}being a high-powered business president is super-fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.73,0:35:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也很辛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}but so exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.60,0:35:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候我真的需要好好休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I just need to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.13,0:35:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要 色情之家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need…Casa Erotica.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.50,0:35:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,客房服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Room service.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.62,0:35:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.30,0:35:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是加百利让你用生命保护的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel wanted you to guard this with your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.36,0:35:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能他是剧迷吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.18,0:35:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这部剧不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.26,0:35:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我送来了你订的波兰熏肠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got the kielbasa you ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.35,0:35:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,波兰的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Polish?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.53,0:35:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,匈牙利的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hungarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.66,0:35:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到底在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.43,0:35:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.80,0:35:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可能很困惑我到底在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're probably wondering what the hell's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.30,0:35:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.56,0:35:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们在看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're watching this…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.19,0:35:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.58,0:35:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.26,0:35:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别悲泣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop sobbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.84,0:35:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我们都很尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's embarrassing for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.79,0:35:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without me,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.99,0:36:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们杀死路西法的几率就等于零\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've got zero shot at killing Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.73,0:36:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.09,0:36:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.91,0:36:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以困住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can trap him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.27,0:36:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个关路西法的牢笼 仍然在下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cage you sprung lucifer from is still down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.77,0:36:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你们 也许 可以把他关回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe … just maybe … you can shove his ass back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.38,0:36:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是那么容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that it'll be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.42,0:36:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们先要打开牢笼 然后把他骗进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to get the cage open, trick my bro back into it,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.49,0:36:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh … oh, yeah …
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.79,0:36:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,避开米迦勒和上帝使团\N{\fnArial\fs30}avoid Michael and the God squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.25,0:36:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 还不够具体 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But hey, details, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.64,0:36:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个惊天大秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here's the big secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.21,0:36:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,连路西法自己也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer himself doesn't even know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.94,0:36:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,牢笼的钥匙 就在世间\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the key to the cage … it's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.67,0:36:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 不止一把钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, it's keys … plural.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.95,0:36:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有四把钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.01,0:36:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,更详细一点 四个戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, four rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.58,0:36:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,天启四骑士的戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the horsemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.06,0:36:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,找全了戒指 就可以打开牢笼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get them all, you got the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.36,0:36:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能说我完全我在把赌注压在你们身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't say I'm betting on you boys,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.02,0:36:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过呢 我曾经犯过错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, uh, hey, I've been wrong before.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.34,0:36:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.70,0:36:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.37,0:36:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害怕对抗我的哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was afraid to stand up to my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.74,0:37:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我不再害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.46,0:37:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我站起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is me standing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.83,0:37:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我又要\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is me…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.59,0:37:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,躺下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lying down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.47,0:37:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.00,0:37:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,天启四骑士 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horsemen, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.01,0:37:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拿到了战争骑士的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we got war's.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.09,0:37:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还拿到了饥饿骑士的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We nicked famine's.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.11,0:37:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有两个戒指了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's two rings down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.44,0:37:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要拿到瘟疫和死亡的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Collect all four,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.61,0:37:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就凑齐四枚戒指了\N{\fnArial\fs30}just need pestilence and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.53,0:37:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.86,0:37:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.84,0:38:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.90,0:38:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个东西会不会让人打瞌睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this stuff make you drowsy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.82,0:38:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还要开很久的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a lot of driving to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.60,0:38:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝色的会让你犯困\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blue ones make you sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.39,0:38:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色的和橘色的可以在白天吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red and orange ones are okay for daytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.19,0:39:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这 这太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is … this is awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.89,0:39:20.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（内华达）
